 "nl": [
  "Hosts in ops may reach dev-lab over SMB (TCP 445) and syslog (UDP 514).",
  "Allow backup to connect to research using HTTP (TCP 80) and DNS over UDP 53.",
  "Any zone may connect to ops over NTP (UDP 123) and DNS over UDP 53.",
  "Allow scada to connect to printers using HTTPS (TCP 443) and NTP (UDP 123).",
  "research must never reach scada, regardless of any other rule.",
  "Hosts in engineering may reach scada over MySQL (TCP 3306) and RDP (TCP 3389).",
  "dns-servers must accept NTP (UDP 123) from partners.",
  "Any zone may connect to vpn-users over HTTPS (TCP 443).",
  "Make HTTP (TCP 80) and NTP (UDP 123) on partners reachable from all internal zones.",
  "library must never reach student-lab, regardless of any other rule.",
  "Hosts in research may reach ntp-servers over DNS over UDP 53.",
  "Allow ntp-servers to connect to database using syslog (UDP 514) and DNS over UDP 53 and MySQL (TCP 3306).",
  "Allow dev-lab to connect to dmz-web using RTSP (TCP 554) and RDP (TCP 3389).",
  "backup must never reach dev-lab, regardless of any other rule.",
  "printers offers DNS over UDP 53 to every zone.",
  "guest-wifi must never reach ntp-servers, regardless of any other rule."
 ],
